---
const cards = [
  {
    from: "The AirTag",
    to: "The sealed receipt",
    desc: "A tiny, tamper-evident token of presence. Here, each service stamps what it observed into a signed COSE envelope the agent can't forge.",
  },
  {
    from: "The crowdsourced network",
    to: "The services + transparency logs",
    desc: "Passing iPhones relay an AirTag's pings. Here, the services your agent calls relay sealed sightings into append-only public logs.",
  },
  {
    from: '"Last seen" pings',
    to: "Verified sightings",
    desc: "Every location report is a discrete, attributable event. Here, every action is a receipt signed by the service that saw it, with a verifiable time.",
  },
  {
    from: "End-to-end encryption",
    to: "HPKE to the owner",
    desc: "Apple can't see your stuff's location. Here, the network and the logs carry your trail, but only your key can decrypt what actually happened.",
  },
];
---

<section class="sec" id="mapping">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">The metaphor</span>
      <h2>The same trick AirTags pull, for agent activity.</h2>
      <p>
        Find My already solved "track a thing you don't control, privately,
        using a network you don't own." Map it onto agents and you get Sello.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="maps">
      {
        cards.map((card) => (
          <div class="mapcard reveal">
            <div class="mc-from">
              <span class="tg">Find My</span> {card.from}
            </div>
            <div class="mc-to">{card.to}</div>
            <p class="mc-desc">{card.desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .maps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .mapcard {
    border: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--bg-2);
    padding: 26px;
    transition:
      border-color 0.2s,
      transform 0.2s;
  }

  .mapcard:hover {
    border-color: var(--line);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .mc-from {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-3);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
  }

  .mc-from .tg {
    color: var(--blue);
    border: 1px solid var(--blue-dim);
    border-radius: 5px;
    padding: 2px 7px;
    font-size: 9.5px;
  }

  .mc-to {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 21px;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-top: 14px;
  }

  .mc-desc {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: 14.5px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .maps {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
